Introduction to the job

In our dynamic international organization, employee health and well-being are a top priority. Therefore, within People Services Europe, we are looking for a driven Health Expert who isn't afraid of a healthy challenge to expand our Health Advisory team.

In this role, you'll make a valuable contribution as a guide, advisor, and coach in the areas of prevention, reintegration, and work (in)capacity for work. You'll also actively collaborate with the team to continuously improve and optimize our services. Are you someone who gets energized by unraveling absenteeism issues, is passionate about vitality, and strives for the best possible service? Then read on!

Role and responsibilities

